%% Youth Account Management - Main User Sequence (Parent transfers funds and sets limits)
sequenceDiagram
    participant Parent as Parent/Guardian
    participant WebApp as Banking Web Application
    participant APIGW as API Gateway
    participant Dashboard as Dashboard Service
    participant FundTransfer as Fund Transfer Service
    participant SpendingLimit as Spending Limit Service
    participant TxHistory as Transaction History Service
    participant AccountSvc as Account Service
    participant TxSvc as Transaction Service
    participant SettingsDB as Settings DB

    Note over Parent,WebApp: OAuth2 login, RBAC enforced
    Parent->>WebApp: Login & access youth dashboard
    WebApp->>APIGW: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/dashboard (OAuth2)
    APIGW->>Dashboard: Route request, RBAC check
    Dashboard->>AccountSvc: Fetch account data
    Dashboard->>SettingsDB: Fetch spending limit
    Dashboard->>TxHistory: Fetch recent transactions
    TxHistory->>TxSvc: Fetch transactions
    Dashboard-->>APIGW: Aggregated dashboard data
    APIGW-->>WebApp: Dashboard JSON
    WebApp-->>Parent: Render dashboard

    Note over Parent,WebApp: Initiate fund transfer
    Parent->>WebApp: Transfer funds
    WebApp->>APIGW: POST /api/youth-accounts/{id}/fund-transfer
    APIGW->>FundTransfer: Route request, RBAC check
    FundTransfer->>AccountSvc: Internal transfer
    FundTransfer-->>APIGW: Transfer result
    APIGW-->>WebApp: Transfer response
    WebApp-->>Parent: Show transfer confirmation

    Note over Parent,WebApp: Set spending limit
    Parent->>WebApp: Set weekly limit
    WebApp->>APIGW: PUT /api/youth-accounts/{id}/spending-limit
    APIGW->>SpendingLimit: Route request, RBAC check
    SpendingLimit->>SettingsDB: Store limit
    SpendingLimit-->>APIGW: Limit updated
    APIGW-->>WebApp: Limit response
    WebApp-->>Parent: Show confirmation

    Note over Parent,WebApp: View transactions
    Parent->>WebApp: View transaction history
    WebApp->>APIGW: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/transactions
    APIGW->>TxHistory: Route request, RBAC check
    TxHistory->>TxSvc: Fetch history
    TxHistory-->>APIGW: History data
    APIGW-->>WebApp: Transactions JSON
    WebApp-->>Parent: Show transaction history

    Note over APIGW,FundTransfer,SpendingLimit: All critical actions logged for audit (NFR)
